<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Philip Services started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Philip Services started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Friday it started coverage  of Philip Services Corp with near- and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/2 to 15-3/8 in early trading.</p>
